<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cortecs 1995/96 year loss narrows.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cortecs 1995/96 year loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>		(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating		     loss 3.8 vs loss 4.2</p>
<p>    Net			     loss 3.8 vs loss 4.2</p>
<p>    Sales				 10.5 vs 7.5</p>
<p>    Dividend			     nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Cortecs International Ltd is a drug research group and is listed on the London stock exchange and the NASDAQ exchange in the United States.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
